  ---
  Common Failure Signatures

  1. Entropy cliff (drops to minimum in < 100k steps)
  Cause:  entropy_coeff too low OR clip_param too tight
  Fix:    Your ENTROPY_COEFF=0.003 is conservative — try 0.005–0.01 early
          CLIP_PARAM=0.1 is already tight, keep it

  2. vf_explained_variance stays negative past 50k steps
  Cause:  VF_LOSS_COEFF too low OR reward scale too high/inconsistent
  Fix:    Your VF_LOSS_COEFF=1.5 is good. Check reward normalization —
          look at MocRewardCalculator.cpp for scale outliers

  3. KL > kl_target (0.01) every iteration
  Cause:  LR too high for current reward scale
  Fix:    Your LEARNING_RATE=8e-5 — try 5e-5 or lower
          Or reduce NUM_SGD_ITER from 4 to 2

  4. Support policy collapses to 0 reward (your previous v10.2.0 issue)
  With independent policies (v10.2.1), check per-policy entropy separately:
    strategy_support_reward_mean stays near 0 past 100k steps
  → Increase HealTickReward or AllyProximityBonus in FSupportRewardSettings